    {
      "after": "<div class=\"faq-list\"><details><summary>Do I need to download an app?<svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#plus\"/></svg></summary><p>Open <span class=\"haw-name\"><svg class=\"haw-wordmark\" viewBox=\"20 20 196 130\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#haw-wordmark-glyphs\"/></svg><span class=\"haw-name-text\">\u1e25\ua723w</span></span> in your browser. You can also add it to your home screen for quick access.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need an account?<svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#plus\"/></svg></summary><p>You can explore the calendar, Library, and Ma\u2019at Flows before signing in. Create an account to save your own calendar entries, Flows, and reflections, and to take part in the community.</p></details><details>",
